{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moon is falling, and the world is ending. Humankind is dying, making <i>Island Cerul</i> the last land on Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet <strong><i>Diallo</i></strong> has to send on the departed to the moon, which is a Moonbard\u2019s purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He will ride on a dramatic journey in an ending world with his benefactor's daughter, <strong><i>Raye</i></strong>, to make for\u00a0<i>Baptismal Terra</i>, the peak of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Song of Moonbard</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/extras/0cb337ac21806f38854627c9ab1344f4.poster.avif?t=1763844446\" width=374 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/extras/0cb337ac21806f38854627c9ab1344f4.webm?t=1763844446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/extras/0cb337ac21806f38854627c9ab1344f4.mp4?t=1763844446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>Moonbard</strong>, you have to face the spirits of the departed. By performing <strong>Moonsongs</strong>, they can return to the moon. You can finish their ascensions by following the rhythm of the moonsong and syncing with the music tempo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unraveling the mysteries of ancient human remains</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/extras/c2fe9ee4639678a2db94af99f42ec21b.avif?t=1763844446\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fantastical instrument you wield, \u201c<strong>Diqin</strong>\u201d, interacts with ancient human ruins to produce unexpected effects. Whether resonating with rocks, rotating structures, or rewinding time, you can forge paths untrodden by those who came before. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A time and weather system highly related with the game world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/extras/b63c6eaf203fb9f8e80693da3882a2ee.avif?t=1763844446\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the high tides, a mountain became <i>Island Cerul</i>. Water is everywhere. As time passes, not only will the weather change, causing high and low tides at sunrise and sunset respectively and affecting the explorable area, but the character's <strong><i>Vitality</i></strong> will also gradually diminish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resting at a bonfire not only advances half a day, altering the time of day and weather conditions, but also restores vitality, keeping movement speed and stamina at optimal levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploring the Human Heritage of the Vast Island Cerul</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/extras/544c321b26e714d67033034269b539d6.avif?t=1763844446\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the vast expanse of <i>Island Cerul</i>, you may explore this towering mountain range, drenched in tidal waters, <strong>seamlessly</strong>, freely venturing into the island's hidden sanctuaries. Within ancient materials awaiting discovery, which can be utilized to rebuild the desolate villages where the characters dwell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reveal the past of the ending world through characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/extras/d1f6e4ac936c4eec030f2a10db2b25b4.avif?t=1763844446\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter numerous living characters and deranged Moonspirits throughout the world, uncovering their stories through dialogue and playing instrument. Acquiring the memories of Moonspirits also enhances your exploration abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2476690?t=1763844446","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763844446","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/741a5cca8b0c2f750a7e074d1ffc679f8eacf6a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763844446","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/741a5cca8b0c2f750a7e074d1ffc679f8eacf6a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763844446","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moon is falling, and the world is ending. Humankind is dying, making <i>Island Cerul</i> the last land on Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet <strong><i>Diallo</i></strong> has to send on the departed to the moon, which is a Moonbard\u2019s purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He will ride on a dramatic journey in an ending world with his benefactor's daughter, <strong><i>Raye</i></strong>, to make for\u00a0<i>Baptismal Terra</i>, the peak of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Song of Moonbard</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/extras/0cb337ac21806f38854627c9ab1344f4.poster.avif?t=1763844446\" width=374 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/extras/0cb337ac21806f38854627c9ab1344f4.webm?t=1763844446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/extras/0cb337ac21806f38854627c9ab1344f4.mp4?t=1763844446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>Moonbard</strong>, you have to face the spirits of the departed. By performing <strong>Moonsongs</strong>, they can return to the moon. You can finish their ascensions by following the rhythm of the moonsong and syncing with the music tempo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unraveling the mysteries of ancient human remains</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/extras/c2fe9ee4639678a2db94af99f42ec21b.avif?t=1763844446\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fantastical instrument you wield, \u201c<strong>Diqin</strong>\u201d, interacts with ancient human ruins to produce unexpected effects. Whether resonating with rocks, rotating structures, or rewinding time, you can forge paths untrodden by those who came before. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A time and weather system highly related with the game world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/extras/b63c6eaf203fb9f8e80693da3882a2ee.avif?t=1763844446\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the high tides, a mountain became <i>Island Cerul</i>. Water is everywhere. As time passes, not only will the weather change, causing high and low tides at sunrise and sunset respectively and affecting the explorable area, but the character's <strong><i>Vitality</i></strong> will also gradually diminish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resting at a bonfire not only advances half a day, altering the time of day and weather conditions, but also restores vitality, keeping movement speed and stamina at optimal levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploring the Human Heritage of the Vast Island Cerul</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/extras/544c321b26e714d67033034269b539d6.avif?t=1763844446\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the vast expanse of <i>Island Cerul</i>, you may explore this towering mountain range, drenched in tidal waters, <strong>seamlessly</strong>, freely venturing into the island's hidden sanctuaries. Within ancient materials awaiting discovery, which can be utilized to rebuild the desolate villages where the characters dwell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reveal the past of the ending world through characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/extras/d1f6e4ac936c4eec030f2a10db2b25b4.avif?t=1763844446\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter numerous living characters and deranged Moonspirits throughout the world, uncovering their stories through dialogue and playing instrument. Acquiring the memories of Moonspirits also enhances your exploration abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["PhantomWorks"],"dlc":[4114790],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476690/b2579b0f61c93c5280f17b3144f28e57292ab0b6/header.jpg?t=1763844446","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 PhantomWorks, All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 2.6GHz 6 Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon Pro 560X 4GB GDDR5<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 13.4 Ventura+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> M1 Pro<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> M1 Pro<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2476690/719374175/8928ae8720aea9fcb5e2eddbf997f16af0f5af0d/1763761207/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763762086","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2476690/719374175/8928ae8720aea9fcb5e2eddbf997f16af0f5af0d/1763761207/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763762086","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2476690/719374175/8928ae8720aea9fcb5e2eddbf997f16af0f5af0d/1763761207/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=17